                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "A grandmother has a fever on a roof in ward 14. Her grandson posts on WhatsApp. A neighbour calls the helpline. Her daughter sends a Telegram message in Hinglish. Three messages, one household, no shared record.",
